<package name="ocaml-optint" project="openSUSE:Factory">
  <title>Efficient integer types on 64-bit architectures</title>
  <description>This library provides two new integer types, `Optint.t` and `Int63.t`, which
guarantee efficient representation on 64-bit architectures and provide a
best-effort boxed representation on 32-bit architectures.

Implementation depends on target architecture.</description>
  <url>https://opam.ocaml.org/packages/optint/</url>
</package>
